OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh Airport to expand
OL,4,Aterminal in #500m investment plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdinburgh Airport has unveiled a #500m
OL,7,Finvestment programme to expand its
OL,8,Fterminal and improve facilities over
OL,9,Fthe next five years.
OL,11,FThe project includes new gates and
OL,12,Faircraft stands, an expanded check-in
OL,13,Fhall and departure lounge, new food and
OL,14,Fretail areas and a 60% larger terminal
OL,15,Ffootprint.
OL,17,FAirport bosses said it would support
OL,18,Fnew long and short haul routes, and
OL,19,Fgrow international connectivity at
OL,20,FScotland's busiest terminal.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
