OL,3,GNEWSAEdinburgh Airport to expand
OL,4,Aterminal in #500m investment plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe investment also includes
OL,7,Fimprovements across the airport campus,
OL,8,Fwith additional electric vehicle
OL,9,Finfrastructure and a new access road.
